OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with the risk of an isolated
OL,7,Flight shower in places but widely dry.
OL,8,FRemaining breezy with gusty winds
OL,9,Faround the coast. A cooler night in
OL,10,Fprospect than last night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA generally fine start to
OL,13,Fthe day, cloud builds with the
OL,14,Fpotential for isolated, mostly light,
OL,15,Fshowers to develop. Remaining breezy,
OL,16,Fparticularly around the coasts, easing
OL,17,Flater. Feeling cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
